Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.88,0:00:51.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡卡罗特
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.76,0:00:57.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡卡罗特
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.32,0:01:46.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,《危险的两人！超战士无法安眠》
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.86,0:02:11.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 纷繁复杂的挑战仍接踵而来 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.52,0:02:16.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 现在不是哭泣的时候呢 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.95,0:02:22.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 让激动的心再加速百倍千倍 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.84,0:02:27.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 跻身主角 让派对为你开 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.58,0:02:33.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 有了值得执迷的 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.50,0:02:35.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 人和事 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.50,0:02:38.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 总有一天就能 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.24,0:02:40.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 让你变得非凡厉害 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.13,0:02:43.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 头顶闪烁 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.87,0:02:46.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 晴空与我常在 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.63,0:02:49.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 心胸开阔 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.63,0:02:52.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 我活力满载 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.20,0:02:55.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 一身泥泞地拼命玩 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.19,0:02:58.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 好动的男孩啊 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.02,0:03:00.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ We Gotta Power ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.89,0:03:06.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 龙珠全能量全开 Z ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.50,0:03:09.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 头顶闪烁 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.39,0:03:12.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 把乱绪全抛开 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.17,0:03:15.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 拉面六碗 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.04,0:03:17.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 妈妈太悠哉 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.63,0:03:20.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 哪怕世纪末 也开怀 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.72,0:03:23.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 活泼的女孩啊 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.49,0:03:26.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ We Gotta Power ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.34,0:03:32.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 龙珠全能量全开 Z ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.42,0:03:48.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.17,0:03:54.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拿到了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.54,0:04:04.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特兰克斯，你呆得真是地方啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.89,0:04:07.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乱追可是追不到龙珠的喔
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.00,0:04:10.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太好了，是兩星球
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.05,0:04:12.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.60,0:04:29.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么我就是这么倒霉呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.94,0:04:32.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你不对，也不看清楚就飞过来
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.58,0:04:35.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,本来差点兩星球就能到手了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.62,0:04:37.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有你这么说话的吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.16,0:04:40.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你说想看神龙的吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.73,0:04:42.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不高兴就回去吧
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.06,0:04:47.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 我人都已经到这儿了，怎么可能回去 - 找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.80,0:04:47.02,CH_SP,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.12,0:04:51.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我找到了，在鸟窝里
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.51,0:05:10.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这就是鸟巢里啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.38,0:05:14.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来只剩四星球了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.30,0:05:20.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特兰克斯，想不到收集龙珠竟然这么简单
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.43,0:05:23.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,多亏有我妈妈造的龙珠雷达啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.52,0:05:28.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,带换洗衣服来就好了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.78,0:05:32.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真想快点许愿啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.12,0:05:36.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想要一个不管乘什么都不用排队
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.80,0:05:40.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能免费玩个痛快的游乐园
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.37,0:05:43.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟天你呢？
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.42,0:05:47.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我啊
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.22,0:05:53.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要一个不管怎么吃，不管吃多少都吃不完的
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.15,0:05:56.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,蛋糕和点心的王国
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.30,0:06:04.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂，这是怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.66,0:06:07.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟天，快把蛋放下
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.30,0:06:09.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特兰克斯，龙珠雷达
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.92,0:06:11.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂，快还给我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.34,0:06:26.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最后一颗就在这附近
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.46,0:06:28.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了就能见到神龙了吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.84,0:06:32.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我肚子饿了，肚子好饿啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.56,0:06:39.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是水晶，水晶的原矿石
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.66,0:06:43.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好美，好炫，令人陶醉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.21,0:06:47.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,女人对闪闪发光的东西就是没有抵抗力啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.26,0:06:49.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂，悟天，我也去
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.06,0:06:51.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一带能採到大量水晶啊
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.40,0:06:53.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 快点，快点 - 悟天，悟天
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.79,0:06:53.95,CH_SP,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.00,0:06:55.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.40,0:06:56.28,CH_SP,NTP,0,0,0,,我肚子也饿了
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.28,0:06:59.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过，明明能採到水晶
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.20,0:07:01.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么这村子看上去那么穷呢
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.83,0:07:04.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们打算撇下我吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.33,0:07:07.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂，你们两个等等我
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.94,0:07:19.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吾等至尊的神明
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.97,0:07:23.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请保护娜塔迪村
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.24,0:07:30.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珂珂
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.84,0:07:35.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对不起，原谅爷爷
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.29,0:07:39.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爷爷，别再哭了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.72,0:07:41.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,珂珂
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.70,0:07:50.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.17,0:08:00.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们是什么人？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.90,0:08:01.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么回事？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.81,0:08:05.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫比迪丽
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.74,0:08:07.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫悟天
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.69,0:08:09.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么人？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.60,0:08:10.74,CH_SP,NTP,0,0,0,,他们到底是从哪儿来的？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.74,0:08:11.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没见过他们
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.90,0:08:14.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们是从哪儿来的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.60,0:08:18.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,空中
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.81,0:08:19.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从空中？
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.46,0:08:22.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不许戏弄我们
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.77,0:08:24.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没戏弄你们啊
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.66,0:08:25.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.31,0:08:58.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怪物在催我们交出活祭
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.10,0:09:02.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怪物要活祭
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.38,0:09:13.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,干嘛，你在怀疑我们吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.30,0:09:14.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别开玩笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.71,0:09:16.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这两个孩子暂且不说
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.29,0:09:18.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我在撒旦市可是正义的伙伴
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.30,0:09:23.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们娜塔迪村也曾因水晶繁盛一时
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.94,0:09:26.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但从7年前开始就变得如此萧条了
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.57,0:09:42.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是山神作祟
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.91,0:09:55.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从7年前开始，这一带遭到异常气候的威胁
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.88,0:10:01.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果只是这样，我们还能克服并继续生活下去
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.59,0:10:06.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但怪物把因气候异常而变得虚弱的动物们吃个精光
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.34,0:10:12.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,飞速成长，开始袭击我们村
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.31,0:10:16.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还一年比一年变本加厉
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.90,0:10:22.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,祭司大人让我们给山神大人献上活祭
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.11,0:10:24.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好让怪物别再来袭击
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.42,0:10:32.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是迷信
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.77,0:10:35.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算交出活祭，情况也不会有所改变
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.90,0:10:40.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别说蠢话
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.10,0:10:46.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你才是，从头到脚都是一副蠢样
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.83,0:10:49.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,无礼的丫头
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.18,0:10:55.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除了听从祭司大人的话，我们别无选择
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.69,0:10:56.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么会
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.84,0:10:59.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们已经无计可施了
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.70,0:11:05.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,村里的年轻人也死于和怪物的战斗
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.26,0:11:10.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样下去，村子将会毁灭
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.15,0:11:18.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果能拯救娜塔迪村的话，我去
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.99,0:11:22.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行，活祭是迷信啊
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.22,0:11:32.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就让我们去制伏怪物吧
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.10,0:11:36.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果我们成功制伏了怪物，作为报酬
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.28,0:11:39.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把大叔胸前的项链送给我们
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.58,0:11:45.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我肚子饿了，能吃个贡品吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.67,0:11:46.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可以
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.74,0:11:49.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可我早上到现在什么都没吃
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.32,0:11:50.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安静点
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.91,0:11:54.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我肚子也饿了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.12,0:11:56.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们就不能安静点吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.08,0:11:58.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这里交给我，你们回去好了
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.95,0:12:02.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想看你被怪物吃掉啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.80,0:12:05.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.35,0:12:17.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肚子饿了，肚子饿了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.94,0:12:20.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我忍不住了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.68,0:12:29.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也拿一个
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.58,0:12:30.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.79,0:12:40.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐打我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.14,0:12:43.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁叫你不听话啊
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.20,0:12:48.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只打我
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.65,0:12:51.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特兰克斯明明也拿了
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.34,0:12:55.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么只打我？
Dialogue: 0,0:12:55.18,0:12:58.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,安静点，怪物会听见的
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.56,0:13:04.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特兰克斯明明也拿了，为什么不打他
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.90,0:13:10.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只打我一个，疼死了，好疼啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.78,0:13:57.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡卡罗特
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.33,0:14:05.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有我什么都没得到
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.10,0:14:07.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了，就只能吃一个喔
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.94,0:14:11.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我什么都没拿到
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.72,0:14:15.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给
Dialogue: 0,0:14:26.23,0:14:28.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,姐姐你还是太单纯了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.77,0:14:30.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被悟天的假哭给骗了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.86,0:14:32.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.70,0:14:39.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.17,0:14:52.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就现在
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.40,0:15:01.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是你袭击村子的吧？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.72,0:15:05.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让比迪丽小姐我来制伏你
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.65,0:15:17.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特兰克斯，说是怪物大人，可看上去像是一头恐龙啊
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.91,0:15:23.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,吼得倒还像那么回事
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.55,0:15:27.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不知道它会喷火吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.35,0:15:30.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,离它远点
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.43,0:15:34.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们是打不过它的
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.61,0:15:39.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,眼睛，能看见吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.00,0:15:47.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好棒，好棒，好棒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.13,0:15:52.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,包子山也没有这样的恐龙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.27,0:16:13.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你指甲也太长了点吧
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.07,0:16:20.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老实一点，我会让你少吃点苦头的
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.43,0:16:34.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这两个孩子好厉害啊
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.68,0:16:49.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样一来，娜塔迪村又将恢复和平了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.33,0:16:53.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比迪丽，特兰克斯，悟天，真是非常感谢你们
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.51,0:16:59.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小菜一碟的事，是吧，悟天
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.36,0:17:00.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.88,0:17:03.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大叔，谢啦
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.82,0:17:06.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个什么「欧巴酱嘛酱那」的怎么说来着
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.17,0:17:44.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都忘了我们是来找龙珠的啊
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.64,0:19:19.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你一大早的干什么啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.32,0:19:41.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,冷不丁地出手想干什么，我饶不了你
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.62,0:19:56.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大叔，吵醒我的后果很严重的喔
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.12,0:20:11.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡卡罗特
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.06,0:20:14.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么，什么卡卡罗特
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.61,0:20:16.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没吃过这种东西
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.70,0:20:18.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡卡罗特
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.50,0:20:21.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我没吃过这种东西
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.60,0:21:07.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好强的气
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.50,0:21:09.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道是
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.90,0:21:29.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,灵活性上我们更胜一筹啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.00,0:21:31.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.70,0:21:38.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他好像不追过来了呢，特兰克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.76,0:21:42.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一定是累了正在休息，因为那家伙是大人
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.45,0:22:18.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,地球上居然有这么厉害的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.33,0:22:20.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是天外有天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.50,0:22:53.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不应该是这样的
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.85,0:23:08.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你怎么了，悟天
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.90,0:23:12.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特兰克斯，你看那儿，那儿那儿
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.50,0:23:14.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那家伙的脚边
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.93,0:23:25.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了，是四星球
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.38,0:23:26.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要拿到它
Dialogue: 0,0:23:26.84,0:23:28.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只要拿到它
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.30,0:23:32.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就能拜托神龙解决那个怪物了
Dialogue: 0,0:23:36.10,0:23:40.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟天，我来引开他，你趁机
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.87,0:23:48.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟小孩还打得这么认真，你真没一点大人样
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.02,0:23:52.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果不服气的话，就让着我们一点啊
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.05,0:23:55.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拍拍屁股
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.02,0:24:05.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就现在
Dialogue: 0,0:24:15.60,0:24:17.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,四星球
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.28,0:24:45.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,四星球不见了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:53.16,0:24:54.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好了
Dialogue: 0,0:24:56.36,0:24:58.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟天，你在搞什么
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.67,0:25:21.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不会饶了那家伙的
Dialogue: 0,0:26:10.20,0:26:11.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舒服了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.81,0:26:16.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了，该找四星球了
Dialogue: 0,0:26:33.44,0:26:36.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟天，你快过来
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.09,0:26:47.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个也不是，这个也不对，也不是这个，这个也…
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.02,0:26:58.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,找到了
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.16,0:27:20.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这种怪物简直就是犯规
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.52,0:27:34.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点走啊
Dialogue: 0,0:27:45.93,0:27:48.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真丢脸，如果看到我这副狼狈样
Dialogue: 0,0:27:49.03,0:27:51.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸一定会生气的
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.73,0:28:05.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想小便了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.53,0:28:21.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特兰克斯，特兰克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.12,0:28:27.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特兰克斯，特兰克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.80,0:28:31.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特兰克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:28:32.17,0:28:34.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我找到四星球了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:34.83,0:28:36.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,7颗都集齐了
Dialogue: 0,0:28:36.53,0:28:38.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特兰克斯，你在哪儿？
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.65,0:28:47.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂，怪物，你的死期已到
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.32,0:28:49.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们有神龙帮助
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.83,0:28:52.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟天，快拜托神龙
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.69,0:28:57.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想道歉就趁现在
Dialogue: 0,0:29:05.65,0:29:08.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神龙，解决那个怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.29,0:29:15.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神龙，打倒那个怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:29:23.37,0:29:25.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喂，喂，神龙
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.45,0:29:30.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚才滚来滚去的，该不会是滚坏了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.26,0:29:33.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟天
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.77,0:29:40.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特兰克斯，神龙不出来啊
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.80,0:29:42.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.80,0:29:49.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我要被他杀了
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.60,0:29:52.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是因为这里太狭小了吧
Dialogue: 0,0:29:53.35,0:29:55.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了，到外面去试试
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.52,0:30:03.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样也可以啊
Dialogue: 0,0:30:24.77,0:30:26.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不行了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.66,0:30:43.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尿出来了
Dialogue: 0,0:30:46.65,0:30:47.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,特兰克斯
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.85,0:31:24.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡卡罗特
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.29,0:32:13.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡卡罗特
Dialogue: 0,0:32:14.09,0:32:17.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡卡罗特
Dialogue: 0,0:32:18.02,0:32:21.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡卡罗特
Dialogue: 0,0:32:35.01,0:32:37.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布罗利，他还活着吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:32:45.99,0:32:47.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟饭哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.81,0:32:51.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:32:53.13,0:32:54.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.94,0:32:57.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟天
Dialogue: 0,0:32:59.61,0:33:02.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对手是布罗利，真亏你们还能平安无事
Dialogue: 0,0:33:03.17,0:33:04.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布罗利
Dialogue: 0,0:33:07.93,0:33:10.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布罗利是谁啊？
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.73,0:33:16.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是7年前被我爸爸打败的传说中的超级赛亚人
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.72,0:33:21.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难怪我，悟天，比迪丽姐姐都打不过他
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.84,0:33:25.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比迪丽也在吗
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.23,0:33:27.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡卡罗特
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.21,0:33:31.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这样，你是追我爸爸而来的
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.94,0:33:33.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但他如今已经不在了
Dialogue: 0,0:33:33.86,0:33:37.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就让我来代替我爸爸打败你
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.11,0:33:56.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真厉害
Dialogue: 0,0:34:01.09,0:34:02.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还和以前一样是个怪物
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.10,0:34:06.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的力量比那时也提升了不少，可还是…
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.80,0:34:14.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:34:19.13,0:34:20.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡卡罗特
Dialogue: 0,0:34:29.33,0:34:30.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比迪丽
Dialogue: 0,0:35:24.67,0:35:25.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:35:58.75,0:36:01.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他果然犯规了
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.12,0:36:13.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟饭
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.47,0:38:24.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是那个，打败布罗利只有靠那个了
Dialogue: 0,0:38:53.14,0:38:54.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就现在
Dialogue: 0,0:39:10.03,0:39:11.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,成功了
Dialogue: 0,0:39:58.81,0:40:00.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,短笛叔叔
Dialogue: 0,0:40:25.71,0:40:27.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,短笛叔叔
Dialogue: 0,0:40:34.31,0:40:35.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小林叔叔
Dialogue: 0,0:40:37.83,0:40:40.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我早就想试试这身衣服了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:44.56,0:40:46.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,幸好赶上了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.50,0:40:48.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小林叔叔，谢谢你
Dialogue: 0,0:40:48.92,0:40:53.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不是你来了，我就和布罗利一样了
Dialogue: 0,0:40:53.88,0:40:56.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我偶尔还是能发挥一点作用的
Dialogue: 0,0:40:57.69,0:41:00.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,布罗利那家伙，居然会追到地球来
Dialogue: 0,0:41:01.22,0:41:04.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,输给悟空可能让他很不甘心吧
Dialogue: 0,0:41:04.64,0:41:06.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不过这次他真的完蛋了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:07.02,0:41:07.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊
Dialogue: 0,0:41:21.50,0:41:22.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道…
Dialogue: 0,0:41:32.59,0:41:36.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不得了的家伙，沉入岩浆居然还活着
Dialogue: 0,0:41:37.93,0:41:40.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我真的被他震惊了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:40.62,0:41:42.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这还是第一次
Dialogue: 0,0:41:43.22,0:41:46.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,18号，对不起，往后就交给你了
Dialogue: 0,0:41:49.44,0:41:50.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小林叔叔
Dialogue: 0,0:41:51.21,0:41:53.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,每次都是我
Dialogue: 0,0:43:31.75,0:43:33.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:43:59.44,0:44:02.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是撒旦先生的女儿啊
Dialogue: 0,0:44:14.50,0:44:15.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比迪丽
Dialogue: 0,0:44:20.25,0:44:21.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你这混蛋
Dialogue: 0,0:44:25.26,0:44:28.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,白费工夫，我现在就让你解脱
Dialogue: 0,0:44:36.74,0:44:38.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,龟派
Dialogue: 0,0:44:40.48,0:44:42.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,气
Dialogue: 0,0:44:44.57,0:44:46.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,功
Dialogue: 0,0:45:01.02,0:45:02.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:45:03.64,0:45:07.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,龟派气功
Dialogue: 0,0:45:08.78,0:45:09.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟天
Dialogue: 0,0:45:29.30,0:45:31.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟饭哥哥，悟天
Dialogue: 0,0:45:39.96,0:45:42.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,力量还不够，我需要更多的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:45:43.50,0:45:46.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神龙，拜托了，帮帮我们
Dialogue: 0,0:45:55.10,0:45:57.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样就叫苦了怎么行
Dialogue: 0,0:45:58.66,0:45:59.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:46:00.60,0:46:01.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:46:01.65,0:46:05.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,使出你们所有的力量
Dialogue: 0,0:46:05.74,0:46:07.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经没有退路了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:18.46,0:46:20.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,神龙把爸爸带来了
Dialogue: 0,0:46:25.60,0:46:27.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡卡罗特
Dialogue: 0,0:46:27.72,0:46:33.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,龟派气功
Dialogue: 0,0:46:43.10,0:46:45.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟饭，你的力量不够
Dialogue: 0,0:46:47.94,0:46:49.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟天别害怕
Dialogue: 0,0:46:52.30,0:46:55.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,放任布罗利把地球摧毁也无所谓吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:46:56.50,0:46:59.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我不在了你们就无法保护地球了吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:47:16.10,0:47:17.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可恶
Dialogue: 0,0:47:17.72,0:47:21.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,居然有我们无法对付的家伙
Dialogue: 0,0:47:30.34,0:47:32.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果这是一场梦，就快让我醒来吧
Dialogue: 0,0:47:54.62,0:47:55.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就现在
Dialogue: 0,0:48:04.06,0:48:05.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡卡罗特
Dialogue: 0,0:48:20.34,0:48:24.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,卡卡罗特
Dialogue: 0,0:48:57.54,0:48:58.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸
Dialogue: 0,0:49:11.70,0:49:14.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爸爸，你来过了是吧
Dialogue: 0,0:49:21.38,0:49:24.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟饭，刚才的怪物呢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:26.70,0:49:29.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对了，悟饭，是你把他干掉了？
Dialogue: 0,0:49:29.61,0:49:31.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不，不是我
Dialogue: 0,0:49:32.00,0:49:34.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又想对我隐瞒
Dialogue: 0,0:49:34.52,0:49:35.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不，那个，我
Dialogue: 0,0:49:35.69,0:49:38.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这次我不会放过你，把一切都告诉我
Dialogue: 0,0:49:41.78,0:49:43.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,站住
Dialogue: 0,0:49:47.02,0:49:49.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我叫你站住
Dialogue: 0,0:49:49.12,0:49:50.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别这样
Dialogue: 0,0:49:50.28,0:49:53.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,悟饭，为什么你总是这样
Dialogue: 0,0:49:53.88,0:49:55.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哥哥
Dialogue: 0,0:49:55.55,0:49:59.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,别管他们，其实他们玩得很欢呢
Dialogue: 0,0:49:59.89,0:50:03.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肚子饿了，我们回村里大吃一顿吧
Dialogue: 0,0:50:03.39,0:50:07.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等我，特兰克斯，我也去
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.35,0:50:10.04,CH_SP,NTP,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:50:07.35,0:50:12.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,- 真的不是我啊 - 突然出现的悟空究竟该如何解释
Dialogue: 0,0:50:12.92,0:50:18.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是龙珠的奇迹，还是刹那间的幻觉呢
Dialogue: 0,0:50:18.49,0:50:21.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谁都不知道
Dialogue: 0,0:50:22.72,0:50:25.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我说啊，是什么都行
Dialogue: 0,0:50:26.12,0:50:28.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就没人记得我还在吗？
Dialogue: 0,0:50:36.10,0:50:39.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ Big Fight ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:50:39.30,0:50:42.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ Big Fight ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:50:48.90,0:50:54.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 燃烧的火焰向上突进蔓延 击穿天空宇宙 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:50:55.30,0:51:00.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 过去和未来全都纠结不清 只能持续战斗 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:00.90,0:51:07.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ Hey Girl 你无止尽的梦想 就是我们的力量 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:07.30,0:51:13.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ Hey Boy 你一丁点的勇气 就能借给我发光 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:13.90,0:51:17.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 不可思议 活力无比 纷乱无序 妙不可语 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:17.50,0:51:23.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 来 奇迹的绝招 得让我见识 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:24.40,0:51:28.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 厉害的 Big Fight! 能让大地烧个焦透 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:28.10,0:51:31.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ Big Fight! 火烫铁拳易放难收 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:31.70,0:51:36.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 就算你有两条命还是不够 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:37.60,0:51:40.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 来一场 Big Fight! 让身体如导弹高飞 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:40.80,0:51:43.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ Big Fight! 一颗心如宝石珍贵 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:44.40,0:51:48.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ 让无限的爱保持璀璨光辉 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:48.50,0:51:52.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ Dragon Ball 永伴随 ∮
Dialogue: 0,0:51:54.00,0:51:56.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,∮ Big Fight ∮
